# Sources of the nums-model study (hub 3.2). NUMS.Go files were read at commit 9e6bbb4; the repository itself is source 2.2.

n: 2.5
name: nums-model-sources
kind: hub
is: The files the nums-model study cites: its own report, the first-round critic, and 31 files of the NUMS.Go repository at commit 9e6bbb4 of 2023-04-05, most of them under http/model and http/config.
at: 2026-11-24

